    },
    {
      "Uid": 19,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_PF_38_NOA_BT_DEFEAT",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "오랜만에 느껴본 <color=#F7BE45>[추위]</color>는 어땠지?",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "久しぶりに感じる<color=#F7BE45>「寒さ」</color>はどうだったかしら？",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 20,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_PF_38_NOA_BT_DEFEAT",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "그래, 알다시피 이 추위야말로 <color=#F7BE45>[공허]</color>의 근원.",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "そう、知っての通り…その寒さこそが<color=#F7BE45>「空虚」</color>の根源。",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 21,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_PF_38_NOA_BT_DEFEAT",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "네가 모든 것을 걸고 대적하기로 한 의무지.",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "貴方がすべてを賭けて立ち向かうことを決めた「義務」よ。",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 22,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_PF_38_NOA_BT_DEFEAT",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "하지만… 의무를 이행하기엔 아직 부족했던 것 같아.",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "でも…義務を果たすには、まだ足りなかったようね。",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 23,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_PF_38_NOA_BT_DEFEAT",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "너에게도, 네가 선택한 아이에게도.",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "貴方にも、貴方が選んだ子にも。",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 24,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_PF_38_NOA_BT_DEFEAT",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "하지만 다음에는 조금 더 나을 거야. ",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "次は、きっともう少し上手くいくはずよ。 ",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 25,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_PF_38_NOA_BT_DEFEAT",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "그러니까 지금은 잠시나마 편히 쉬렴.",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "だから今は、しばらくゆっくり休んで。",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 26,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_PF_38_NOA_BT_DEFEAT",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "나의 벗, 나의 계약자…",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "私の友、私の契約者…",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 27,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_PF_38_NOA_BT_DEFEAT",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "그리고 나의… 구원자님.",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "そして私の…救援者様。",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    }
  ]
